Z||000000||Dan87GT||07-20-2001||10:03 PM||||I am putting in a new oil pump and was wondering if there is a gasket between the oil pump and bearing cap, V6 motor. Or should I just use a little RTV.<BR>Thanks, ||||reg||1
Z||000001||Steve Normington||07-20-2001||10:14 PM||||No gasket. I don't know if RTV is a good idea because of the possibility of boogers getting into the oil passages.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Indiana_resto_guy||07-21-2001||06:24 AM||||Put it on BARE!<BR>No gasket material what-so-ever!<BR>Both are machine surfaces and will seat tight.||||reg||1
